        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Abdomen soft with mild suprapubic and right inguinal tenderness. No guarding or rebound, no mass, bowel sounds normal. No obvious inguinal hernia on attempted Valsalva."
      }
    },
    {
